WEBVTT

00:00:05.406 --> 00:00:08.307
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:11.879
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.879 --> 00:00:13.938
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.782 --> 00:00:18.912
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.488 --> 00:00:23.324
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.324 --> 00:00:25.451
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.227 --> 00:00:30.254
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:31.966 --> 00:00:34.736
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.736 --> 00:00:37.364
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.638 --> 00:00:41.233
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.677 --> 00:00:47.341
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.349 --> 00:00:49.851
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.851 --> 00:00:53.048
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.889 --> 00:00:57.058
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.058 --> 00:01:01.119
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.362 --> 00:01:05.992
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.769 --> 00:01:09.259
Let's go!

00:01:12.507 --> 00:01:15.965
SLEEPING BEAUTY

00:01:33.995 --> 00:01:36.293
I don't know if you'll
like this or not, but...

00:01:38.066 --> 00:01:38.998
Here.

00:01:40.234 --> 00:01:42.759
You're such strange creatures.

00:01:44.072 --> 00:01:46.438
Even though you've captured
your enemy's empress...

00:01:46.741 --> 00:01:49.073
...you neither imprison
nor interrogate me.

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:50.570
You're right.

00:01:51.913 --> 00:01:52.709
Why not?

00:01:54.916 --> 00:01:56.781
Maybe it's because
of the captain.

00:01:57.485 --> 00:01:58.474
Because of Paco-Paco?

00:01:59.053 --> 00:02:01.681
He risked his life saving you.

00:02:01.823 --> 00:02:04.087
How could we think of
mistreating you after that?

00:02:05.927 --> 00:02:07.485
The Soyokaze
is a military vessel.

00:02:07.762 --> 00:02:10.993
That's why we obey our
commander's orders to the letter.

00:02:14.602 --> 00:02:15.398
Paco-Paco!

00:02:21.609 --> 00:02:22.439
Doctor...

00:02:26.781 --> 00:02:27.645
Mind control?

00:02:28.216 --> 00:02:29.240
I think so.

00:02:35.723 --> 00:02:40.626
There's no other reason they'd have
implanted a biochip into his brain.

00:02:41.095 --> 00:02:44.656
You mean, if you don't remove it,
the captain will!

00:02:45.466 --> 00:02:50.165
Even if he wakes up, I don't know
if he'll have his old personality.

00:02:50.771 --> 00:02:51.533
You mean?!

00:02:55.409 --> 00:02:57.172
It's not unheard of.

00:02:57.812 --> 00:03:00.246
I doubt they'd allow
a prisoner to live...

00:03:00.314 --> 00:03:02.976
...without doing something
like this to him.

00:03:03.484 --> 00:03:04.746
Damn it all!

00:03:05.052 --> 00:03:08.488
Doctor, what did you mean
"even if" he wakes up?!

00:03:09.157 --> 00:03:10.522
You mean he might not?

00:03:12.093 --> 00:03:14.118
The other treatments
I made were successful.

00:03:14.495 --> 00:03:15.393
However...

00:03:16.464 --> 00:03:17.123
However?

00:03:17.465 --> 00:03:21.162
There's too high a risk for
me to attempt brain surgery.

00:03:23.638 --> 00:03:28.974
In other words, he may never
wake up. He might even...

00:03:29.177 --> 00:03:30.269
That can't be!

00:03:36.918 --> 00:03:38.146
Your Highness...

00:03:39.153 --> 00:03:42.384
You're saying Paco-Paco
may sleep forever?

00:03:43.291 --> 00:03:45.452
That you can't save him?

00:03:51.499 --> 00:03:54.161
It's all my fault!
And now he'll never!

00:03:59.073 --> 00:03:59.937
Your Highness!

00:04:07.515 --> 00:04:08.880
Don't worry.

00:04:09.317 --> 00:04:11.842
She may be an empress,
but she's still a young girl.

00:04:12.019 --> 00:04:15.318
The strain of all that's
happened just got to her.

00:04:16.891 --> 00:04:17.949
Paco-Paco...

00:04:18.726 --> 00:04:23.425
Paco-Paco, huh? It's a good
name for the captain, isn't it?

00:04:23.764 --> 00:04:30.101
Looks like he was a real support
to our young empress here.

00:04:32.373 --> 00:04:36.901
Damn, if he knows a way to win the
heart of a young girl like this...

00:04:37.211 --> 00:04:39.145
...I'd love to know what it is.

00:04:39.847 --> 00:04:44.147
Doctor, is there really
no way to save the captain?

00:04:47.455 --> 00:04:51.391
You said the risk was too high,
so there must be some way!

00:05:03.471 --> 00:05:06.338
I helped myself to some
of your fancy green tea.

00:05:09.844 --> 00:05:10.640
Take it away.

00:05:11.946 --> 00:05:16.440
To make a wish come true, you must
do without your favorite thing.

00:05:17.918 --> 00:05:19.385
Until the wish
comes true, okay?

00:05:24.659 --> 00:05:26.126
What is this?

00:05:26.394 --> 00:05:29.056
The Deep Psychological Synchronizer.

00:05:30.231 --> 00:05:32.563
In other words...
Harumi, start it, please.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:33.496
Yes, sir.

00:05:34.602 --> 00:05:37.002
Okay, these are Tylor's brain waves.

00:05:40.241 --> 00:05:43.369
And this is another brain wave
pattern we synch to it.

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:50.908
The DPS can allow another person
to enter Tylor's psyche...

00:05:51.052 --> 00:05:53.543
...and release his
original personality.

00:05:53.988 --> 00:05:56.752
And that will turn the
captain back to normal?

00:05:57.291 --> 00:05:58.258
I believe so.

00:05:58.659 --> 00:05:59.648
I'll do it!

00:06:00.094 --> 00:06:02.153
Don't volunteer lightly!

00:06:02.663 --> 00:06:03.687
What do you mean?

00:06:04.265 --> 00:06:08.759
A person's body is innerspace.
A universe within this one.

00:06:08.936 --> 00:06:11.928
And the section upstairs is the
most complicated part of it!

00:06:12.473 --> 00:06:17.240
They say a person's innermost
soul is unknown even to them.

00:06:17.311 --> 00:06:20.542
Imagine forcing someone
else's psyche into there.

00:06:20.948 --> 00:06:23.746
One wrong move and the mind of
the person going in goes snap!

00:06:24.485 --> 00:06:25.952
S- Snap?

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:29.812
For the sake of the captain,
you might ruin your life.

00:06:30.257 --> 00:06:31.815
Still interested?

00:06:34.028 --> 00:06:37.020
What do we do once
we're inside his mind?

00:06:37.698 --> 00:06:38.824
I don't know.

00:06:39.367 --> 00:06:40.231
You don't know?!

00:06:41.369 --> 00:06:44.395
There isn't a set medical
procedure for this.

00:06:44.872 --> 00:06:47.636
There's one case on record,
where a comatose girl was...

00:06:47.708 --> 00:06:52.270
...accidentally brain-synched with
a similarly comatose old man...

00:06:52.346 --> 00:06:55.213
...and the girl was
able to be awakened.

00:06:57.051 --> 00:06:59.713
So, this has worked before!

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:05.449
However, the old man died in
exchange for reviving the girl.

00:07:08.329 --> 00:07:11.196
Doctor... I'll do it!

00:07:11.732 --> 00:07:12.630
Commander Star!

00:07:13.267 --> 00:07:15.394
Even if something happens
to the captain and me...

00:07:15.536 --> 00:07:18.004
...the Soyokaze will
be safe with you here!

00:07:18.139 --> 00:07:19.003
But...

00:07:19.373 --> 00:07:22.001
We won't know until we try,
so I say we should try it!

00:07:23.277 --> 00:07:25.040
I won't take
responsibility for this.

00:07:25.746 --> 00:07:29.079
Oh, like you've ever taken
responsibility for anything?

00:07:32.386 --> 00:07:33.614
Things will work out...

00:07:51.105 --> 00:07:54.040
Okay? If it gets dangerous,
no matter what it does...

00:07:54.408 --> 00:07:56.933
...I'll yank your brain wave
pattern out of there.

00:07:57.211 --> 00:07:57.836
Right!

00:08:10.558 --> 00:08:12.082
Synchro start!

00:08:31.445 --> 00:08:32.537
Take me with you!

00:08:36.417 --> 00:08:37.611
Don't open it!

00:08:38.486 --> 00:08:41.182
They've begun synchronization!
It's too late!

00:09:17.391 --> 00:09:19.154
Did it work?

00:09:20.494 --> 00:09:21.791
Where are we?

00:09:22.863 --> 00:09:24.262
What are you doing here?!

00:09:25.633 --> 00:09:27.692
Paco-Paco is my pet!

00:09:55.563 --> 00:09:58.532
Don't ask me why, but that
girl jumped in with you...

00:09:58.599 --> 00:10:01.830
...and the synchronization
came off without a hitch!

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:07.437
Okay? You have to go up from
where you are to get to that chip.

00:10:08.242 --> 00:10:11.143
Right...
Think of climbing a hill.

00:10:11.812 --> 00:10:12.608
A hill?

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:14.973
Just think of it that way.

00:10:18.886 --> 00:10:20.683
Right, that's the way.

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:33.928
What?!

00:10:37.805 --> 00:10:42.833
You are Justy Ueki Tylor.
Age twenty. Male. Application E-7.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:44.343
Is this information correct?

00:10:44.945 --> 00:10:49.348
That's... A computer image
from a UPSF entrance test.

00:10:50.117 --> 00:10:51.084
What's going on?

00:10:58.592 --> 00:10:59.559
That's!

00:11:00.561 --> 00:11:02.995
You get angry quite often.

00:11:06.967 --> 00:11:12.428
I see... Each of these is a
thread of the captain's memory.

00:11:13.574 --> 00:11:16.975
Each time I touch one of these,
a different woman appears.

00:11:17.945 --> 00:11:21.506
So many different women...
Why is that?

00:11:22.282 --> 00:11:25.217
I suppose this means that
the captain's memory system...

00:11:25.285 --> 00:11:28.982
...is extremely efficient
where women are concerned.

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:32.381
Then I must be in
here somewhere, too!

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:39.895
Don't you dare!
We're inside the captain's mind!

00:11:40.334 --> 00:11:41.824
Don't go wandering off!

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.597
Paco-Paco belongs to me!

00:11:45.005 --> 00:11:48.236
You've no right to tell me
what to do with him!

00:12:03.624 --> 00:12:05.023
You're incredible!

00:12:05.993 --> 00:12:07.620
Whoa, babe alert!

00:12:08.629 --> 00:12:10.859
She's so cute
when she's angry!

00:12:11.031 --> 00:12:12.293
It's Paco-Paco's voice!

00:12:16.003 --> 00:12:19.370
I'm so happy to be held
by such a beautiful girl!

00:12:20.207 --> 00:12:23.836
Hey, not so grabby!
You scared me!

00:12:23.944 --> 00:12:24.740
Sorry.

00:12:25.312 --> 00:12:29.544
No! No! I'm your slave!
Order me to do anything!

00:12:30.384 --> 00:12:33.148
I told you to be quiet.
Don't be so full of yourself.

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:35.044
What are you saying?

00:12:35.522 --> 00:12:37.319
What is all this?

00:12:38.692 --> 00:12:42.025
I am the captain!
You must do what I say!

00:12:44.064 --> 00:12:47.227
No! No! I'll listen to
anything a pretty girl says!

00:12:47.334 --> 00:12:49.325
I'll listen to anything
from a beauty like you!

00:12:49.403 --> 00:12:53.032
Go on, say anything! I've never
seen anyone as pretty as you!

00:12:54.074 --> 00:12:56.838
Captain, what's your problem?

00:12:57.411 --> 00:13:01.313
But he's complimenting you.
You shouldn't get angry about that.

00:13:02.282 --> 00:13:04.944
These aren't what
I consider compliments.

00:13:05.052 --> 00:13:08.681
Why are you angry? You don't
like being complimented?

00:13:08.889 --> 00:13:10.516
No, it's not that.

00:13:11.391 --> 00:13:14.360
That's right, women are
best when they're gentle.

00:13:14.561 --> 00:13:17.052
How can you like ones that
oppose you at every turn?

00:13:17.431 --> 00:13:21.026
It's hard to like somebody who
thinks that only they are right.

00:13:21.301 --> 00:13:22.393
That's...

00:13:22.703 --> 00:13:26.469
See? Paco-Paco's angry at
how conceited you are.

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:31.903
Listen, kid, I can't be there to
play with you forever, you know.

00:13:32.045 --> 00:13:33.376
Wh- What?

00:13:33.614 --> 00:13:37.175
Uh-uh! I'll always be ready
to play with cute girls!

00:13:37.751 --> 00:13:41.915
It's easier to play the fool
than risk getting tortured.

00:13:42.322 --> 00:13:44.381
Get back alive and you're
a hero! You're a success!

00:13:44.558 --> 00:13:46.685
But if you die, that's it.

00:13:47.127 --> 00:13:49.061
Sorry, but I don't
want to fight anymore.

00:13:49.363 --> 00:13:51.024
Maybe I can live with
you and have fun!

00:13:51.465 --> 00:13:53.763
Paco-Paco,
what are you saying?

00:14:04.478 --> 00:14:05.604
Yuriko!

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:10.582
Doctor! There's lots of captains
in here! I don't understand them!

00:14:10.784 --> 00:14:12.251
Lots of captains?

00:14:12.486 --> 00:14:17.719
You both may be in contact
with his subconscious!

00:14:18.125 --> 00:14:20.116
Doctor, what should I do?

00:14:20.727 --> 00:14:21.625
I don't know.

00:14:22.663 --> 00:14:26.121
I told you, a person's
body is innerspace!

00:14:26.433 --> 00:14:30.335
How can anyone know about the
shapeless psyche of another mind?!

00:14:31.305 --> 00:14:34.763
Success! I quit! Hero!

00:14:34.842 --> 00:14:36.710
I love Yuriko! I hate her!

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:39.112
Stop! What do you want to say?!
I love Yuriko! I hate her!

00:14:39.112 --> 00:14:42.549
I love Azalyn! I hate her!
Success! I quit! Hero!

00:14:42.549 --> 00:14:43.880
Stop it, Paco-Paco.

00:14:44.618 --> 00:14:46.643
Don't you...
Don't you recognize me?

00:14:47.521 --> 00:14:50.490
Don't you recognize me?!

00:14:56.763 --> 00:14:57.559
Uh-oh!

00:15:00.167 --> 00:15:03.261
Yuriko, what's wrong?!
Answer me!

00:15:08.542 --> 00:15:11.511
Have they gotten caught
in his subconscious?

00:15:19.553 --> 00:15:20.383
Where?

00:15:26.193 --> 00:15:29.492
So, Paco-Paco...
You recognize me?

00:15:34.134 --> 00:15:35.396
The captain's face...

00:15:36.403 --> 00:15:38.200
It's reacting to Azalyn's words.

00:15:45.279 --> 00:15:48.407
Don't! Come down!
It's too dangerous!

00:15:49.416 --> 00:15:53.580
We have nothing to fear.
This is Paco-Paco's mind, right?

00:15:54.421 --> 00:15:56.981
Why?
How can you be so calm?

00:15:57.758 --> 00:16:00.625
Paco-Paco would never
do anything to harm me.

00:16:07.434 --> 00:16:10.995
I see.
If you want to, you may.

00:16:11.538 --> 00:16:13.836
You can understand what
the captain's saying?

00:16:14.508 --> 00:16:17.068
Of course. Can't you?

00:16:17.844 --> 00:16:18.708
I...

00:16:20.113 --> 00:16:22.104
You can't hear him
unless you listen closely.

00:16:22.649 --> 00:16:25.209
You always get angry
and never listen.

00:16:25.585 --> 00:16:26.745
Right, Paco-Paco?

00:16:26.987 --> 00:16:30.821
But... I don't
LIKE to get angry!

00:16:31.191 --> 00:16:32.818
Paco-Paco is kind.

00:16:33.827 --> 00:16:35.761
Paco-Paco is really so kind...

00:16:58.518 --> 00:16:59.450
Azalyn!

00:16:59.886 --> 00:17:01.979
Yuriko, can you hear me?
Yuriko!

00:17:02.656 --> 00:17:04.749
It's no use!
I don't read either of them!

00:17:06.326 --> 00:17:09.056
No choice then.
We'll have to pull them out.

00:17:13.934 --> 00:17:16.368
Doctor, I can't isolate
the empress' brain waves!

00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:18.899
You can't isolate them?

00:17:19.473 --> 00:17:21.703
No, wait. She's synched
in too deeply!

00:17:22.009 --> 00:17:23.237
What do you mean?

00:17:23.643 --> 00:17:27.135
Azalyn's mind has fallen
asleep with the captain's.

00:17:42.362 --> 00:17:44.626
Captain, what do you
think you're doing?!

00:17:47.367 --> 00:17:51.269
Doctor! Doctor!
What should I do?!

00:17:56.009 --> 00:17:59.137
Your Highness, wake up!
Highness!

00:17:59.980 --> 00:18:02.676
Let me sleep with Paco-Paco...

00:18:03.016 --> 00:18:06.076
No, Highness! We have
to bring the captain back!

00:18:06.453 --> 00:18:07.920
Let me do what I want...

00:18:08.889 --> 00:18:11.722
No, we have to go back!
Everyone's waiting!

00:18:15.062 --> 00:18:19.431
Stop playing around! Captain, I'm
bringing you back no matter what!

00:18:19.866 --> 00:18:23.461
I won't let you die like this
after we finally rescued you!

00:18:24.304 --> 00:18:27.330
Who do you think we
did all this for?!

00:18:27.541 --> 00:18:31.500
We all turned against the military
because we wanted you back!

00:18:31.878 --> 00:18:33.971
Because no one but
you deserves...

00:18:34.047 --> 00:18:35.947
...to sit in the
Soyokaze's captain's seat!

00:18:36.349 --> 00:18:37.941
And now... Now you're!

00:18:39.352 --> 00:18:40.717
CAPTAIN!

00:18:42.722 --> 00:18:43.484
Uh-oh!

00:18:44.057 --> 00:18:45.991
Now stop this and wake up!

00:18:46.426 --> 00:18:49.657
Who do you think that
captain's seat is waiting for?!

00:18:50.097 --> 00:18:52.088
Justy Ueki Tylor!

00:19:02.609 --> 00:19:03.439
Uh-oh!

00:19:19.126 --> 00:19:21.526
Who do you think that
captain's seat...

00:19:22.429 --> 00:19:23.828
...is waiting for?!

00:19:33.807 --> 00:19:34.569
Yuriko!

00:19:35.075 --> 00:19:36.201
Commander Star!

00:19:43.083 --> 00:19:43.811
I'm...

00:19:44.417 --> 00:19:47.181
Thank God...
We thought we'd lost you.

00:19:51.324 --> 00:19:51.949
The captain?!

00:20:01.201 --> 00:20:02.190
Forgive me!

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:06.462
If I'd just tried harder...

00:20:15.482 --> 00:20:16.278
Doctor!

00:20:18.084 --> 00:20:20.109
Tha- That's impossible...

00:20:23.523 --> 00:20:25.081
It's my fault!

00:20:25.859 --> 00:20:26.826
Paco-Paco!

00:20:32.866 --> 00:20:33.594
Umm...

00:20:34.534 --> 00:20:35.558
Captain...

00:20:36.536 --> 00:20:39.664
Justy Ueki Tylor. Age twenty.

00:20:42.876 --> 00:20:43.934
Paco-Paco!

00:20:45.445 --> 00:20:46.639
YOW!!!

00:20:47.547 --> 00:20:50.072
Azalyn, that sort of hurts.

00:20:51.017 --> 00:20:52.541
Then let it hurt!

00:20:56.890 --> 00:20:59.017
It... It worked?

00:21:00.727 --> 00:21:01.659
Who knows?

00:21:08.401 --> 00:21:11.461
Huh? Yuriko, your skin
looks a little dry.

00:21:11.771 --> 00:21:12.635
You tired?

00:21:15.508 --> 00:21:17.772
And who do you think
I got so tired for?

00:21:35.762 --> 00:21:36.854
Just who...

00:21:40.233 --> 00:21:42.929
Just who do you think
I got so tired for?

00:21:50.210 --> 00:21:51.142
What's with you?

00:21:51.745 --> 00:21:54.407
CAPTAIN!!!

00:22:13.033 --> 00:22:14.057
The Irresponsible Captain Tylor
Next Episode

00:22:15.735 --> 00:22:20.297
Age sixteen. It's a
special time for people.

00:22:20.573 --> 00:22:23.235
Now, the empress moves
to the next step in her life.

